Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Keep a held mark over a reload, close stale offer cards,
 and draw held marks on the Lightkeeper's copy

The desk: a mark sent from the sheet and still unanswered is now kept in the
persisted store with its mark_id and when it was taken, and sent again when
the same character's socket opens after a reload, so a mark taken during a
silent outage is no longer lost (#43); the server takes it once. One taken
more than ten minutes before is let go with a line under the marks: "A Body
mark taken before the reload may not have counted. Check the trauma
record."

mark_offer_closed with dropped and an offer_id (the server's answer to a
card it did not hold, #18) closes only that card and lets go of the marks
its answer sent on their way, so a newer card stays.

The read-only sheet (the Lightkeeper's copy) draws the marks the sheet's
held_marks names as dashed held boxes with the "held for" line (#23).

Checked with a vite build; browser checks follow.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
